OHOS: URI authorization, `filesDir` OCR/QR models, and the second
authorization for a recognition result's companion .txt file all have real
platform callers and cannot be collapsed into a plain `QFile` URI write.
Regular and scrolling screenshot-save had two implementations that were
statement-for-statement identical except for how the source image was
constructed; merge them into one `saveSourceToFile` helper, removing about
100 duplicated lines while keeping error handling, thread hand-off, cleanup
and history-completion behavior byte-for-byte the same.

